                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e71bd067-ba7f-35ca-8e1e-4c9d45f7249b",
                        "entry_id": "530a8a17-48eb-3903-9df0-21e25850dc4b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A win achieving five han, or three/four han with the required number of fu; worth 12,000 points if the winning player is on the East (dealer) side or 8,000 points otherwise."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Japanese"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5d7a73b-6336-4dfd-b056-260383ad6e59",
                                "sense_id": "e71bd067-ba7f-35ca-8e1e-4c9d45f7249b",
                                "text": "Even if she gets +8000 points with a mangan, she'll be at -1."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c69f2216-fe52-4e16-b223-00a8038c13aa",
                                "sense_id": "e71bd067-ba7f-35ca-8e1e-4c9d45f7249b",
                                "text": "Outside tournaments the chombo penalty is a reverse mangan payment: 4,000 to East, 2,000 to other players."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1822d43a-3276-4765-aaa8-95ea393c7e27",
                                "sense_id": "e71bd067-ba7f-35ca-8e1e-4c9d45f7249b",
                                "text": "In mahjong last night I had a six-han hand! I got a mangan."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6c5ae9f-fdbf-4437-92e9-275fb3b5a90a",
                                "sense_id": "e71bd067-ba7f-35ca-8e1e-4c9d45f7249b",
                                "text": "By the time they'd reached the twelfth round, Kobayashi had won the first hand by drawing his winning tile. \"Tsumo! Riizumo, pinfu, dora 2—Mangan. 2000, 4000!\" Incredibly, Kobayashi had won a full 8000 points on his first hand."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
